flowchart LR
  P[Payments: 9 tables] --> CDC[StreamServe CDC]
  F[Fincrime: 5 tables] --> CDC
  A[Amplitude events] --> B[Fivetran daily sync]
  CDC --> RAW[RAW: current-row replica contract]
  B --> RAW
  RAW --> STG[15 typed staging views]
  STG --> INT[4 intermediate views]
  INT --> MARTS[9 production marts]
  STG --> MARTS
  FX[Additional approved USD rate dependency] -.-> MARTS
  STG --> POC[3 isolated exploratory models]
  MARTS --> SEM[6 semantic models / 5 required metrics + helpers]
  POC -.-> SEM
  SEM --> HEX[Planned Hex consumers]
